{"Removing config.i18n.fallbacks = true from environment files makes fallback behavior entirely dependent on config/initializers/i18n.rb, which has no numeric prefix to guarantee it loads after 02-freedom_patches.rb. If the initializer loads first or fails, I18n.ensure_loaded! will be undefined and fallbacks will be silently absent in production.": 0.44643762707710266, "@loaded_locales may be nil causing NoMethodError in translate method - translate calls @loaded_locales.include?(config.locale) without ensuring @loaded_locales is initialized, and if @loaded_locales is nil (before reload! or ensure_loaded! has run), calling include? on nil will raise NoMethodError": 0.597120463848114, "@loaded_locales may be nil causing NoMethodError in load_locale method - load_locale's guard inside the mutex (return if @loaded_locales.include?(locale)) will raise if @loaded_locales is nil when load_locale is called directly": 0.6189264059066772, "Calling I18n.fallbacks.ensure_loaded! on every request in set_locale before_filter incurs method dispatch overhead and on first access may perform file IO and DB access, causing potential performance regression under load": 0.1473471224308014, "If ensure_loaded! is called before the freedom_patches initialization it may raise, and calling this on every request increases surface area for race conditions": 0.1713557243347168}